OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FManly cloudy, and while dry for
OL,6,Fmost of the region, there will be a
OL,7,Flittle rain over western areas towards
OL,8,FBraemar. Best chance of any sunny
OL,9,Fintervals towards the Buchan coast.
OL,10,FFresh southeasterly winds along the
OL,11,Fcoast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FMainly cloudy, with just some
OL,14,Fpatchy rain or showers at first but
OL,15,Frain becoming more persistent later in
OL,16,Fthe night.
OL,17,
OL,18,CWednesday:FLargely cloudy on Wednesday
OL,19,Fwith occasionally heavy rain at times.
OL,20,FTurning clearer during the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
